 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Hinokami-sama no Souji Hito desu ga, Itsunomanika Hanayome to shite Dekiaisareteimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "火の神さまの掃除人ですが、いつの間にか花嫁として溺愛されています"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Work as a Cleaner for the Fire God… But I Became His Pampered Bride!"
   },
   {
    "en": "from a worthless maid to a pampered bride"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where gods and spiritual forces intertwine, a young noblewoman was born into a sacred family tasked with pleasing the gods through their spiritual abilities. But she was different—her power was too weak, making her an outcast, especially in the eyes of her mother and half-sister.\n\nIn the end, she is sold off to mysterious beings in another realm, where she finds herself standing before a shunned and despised god due to his unusual appearance—the Fire God, known as Hoozuki.\n\nBut the surprise? While everyone else recoils in disgust, she alone sees his true beauty.\n\nWhat began as a mere transaction quickly transforms into an irresistible love, as the Fire God showers her with a warmth she has never known before.\n\nWill she be able to stay by his side despite the obstacles, or will fate lead her down a different path?\n\nA fantasy romance inspired by the Taisho era of Japan, where a cruel fate turns into a legendary love story!"
  },
